---
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Label" code={'<p class="label">Aero platform</p>\n<p class="label label-muted">Library</p>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Names what follows: a section, a product, a category. Monospace capitals in brand coral; muted where coral would be too loud.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <p class="label">Aero platform</p>
        <p class="label">01 · Principles</p>
        <p class="label label-muted">Library</p>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Badges" code={'<span class="badge">Secondary</span>\n<span class="badge badge-primary">Primary</span>\n<span class="badge badge-success">Success</span>   /* warning | danger | info */\n<span class="badge badge-pill">Pill</span>\n<span class="badge badge-family family-studio">Studio</span>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Stride's badges: short markers for status, version or category, in a semantic intent, squared off (small radius) or as a pill. ONIXLabs adds family badges on the deepened product gradient.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <span class="badge">Secondary</span>
        <span class="badge badge-primary">Primary</span>
        <span class="badge badge-success">Success</span>
        <span class="badge badge-warning">Warning</span>
        <span class="badge badge-danger">Danger</span>
        <span class="badge badge-info">Info</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline">v1.0</span>
    </div>
    <div class="row spaced">
        <span class="badge badge-pill">Pill</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pill badge-primary">Open source</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pill badge-brand">New</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pill badge-family family-aero">Aero</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pill badge-family family-studio">Studio</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pill badge-family family-player">ONIXPlayer</span>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Announcement pill" code={'<a class="pill" href="…"><span class="badge badge-pill badge-brand">New</span> Introducing Aero <Icon name="caret-right" /></a>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>One per page at most, above the hero headline, for a launch or a headline product.</p></Fragment>
    <a class="pill" href="#announcement-pill"><span class="badge badge-pill badge-brand">New</span> Introducing Aero, the modular .NET suite <Icon name="caret-right" /></a>
</Specimen>

<style>
    .spaced {
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    }
</style>
